  "content": "<html>\n<body>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/18RsKn1.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=252A36&amp;labelColor=FF424D&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=follow&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=1D9BF0&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>关于：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p>曼荼罗GUI是一款优雅的主题，采用曼荼罗创作风格。<br>专为喜欢暗色模式的玩家打造。<br>仅修改Minecraft的用户界面，不影响物品或方块。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特点：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>暗色模式用户界面。</li>\n<li>扁平且现代的配色。</li>\n<li>蓝灰色调色板。</li>\n<li>兼容模组（模组列表见文件描述）。</li>\n</ul><p><span><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">模组支持及替代纹理</span></strong>将迁移至<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\">曼荼罗GUI - 扩展包</a>（完全迁移所有扩展需要一定时间）。❤</span></p><p><br><a href=\"https://lega